Due to the small Kernel Partition on DGN3500/3500B models, the router would not boot on versions 22.03.00 - 22.03.03.
This is was fixed in [[https://openwrt.org/releases/22.03/changelog-22.03.4#targetlantiq_6_changes|OpenWrt 22.03.04]].

